WEBVTT

00:00.750 --> 00:01.710
<b><i>This is the story of...</i></b>

00:05.210 --> 00:07.210
<b><i>Metry, that is to say,</i></b>

00:10.260 --> 00:13.180
<b><i>the story of a devil.</i></b>

00:23.810 --> 00:27.560
<b>There once was a girl named Reiko.</b>

00:31.240 --> 00:33.070
<b>Who is Reiko?</b>

00:33.150 --> 00:34.570
<b>It's her name, isn't it?</b>

00:40.540 --> 00:42.250
<b>Her dream</b>

00:42.330 --> 00:45.820
<b>was to have a happy family.</b>

00:46.500 --> 00:49.040
<b>In order to have that,</b>

00:49.130 --> 00:51.550
<b>Reiko got a beautiful house</b>

00:51.630 --> 00:55.220
<b>together with a doctor who cured ailments.</b>

00:55.300 --> 00:57.640
<b>Thus Reiko's life</b>

00:57.720 --> 01:01.970
<b>was like a perfectly balanced painting.</b>

01:02.060 --> 01:03.560
<b>It was perfect.</b>

01:03.640 --> 01:05.890
<b>That is exactly what it was.</b>

01:06.770 --> 01:07.770
<b>Yes.</b>

01:11.440 --> 01:14.150
<b>Until the day they took in that maid.</b>

02:50.580 --> 02:53.340
<b>Madam! Please help me!</b>

02:53.420 --> 02:54.630
<b>I'm getting sucked in!</b>

02:55.460 --> 02:58.050
<b>Madam!</b>

03:02.180 --> 03:04.180
<b>Goodness me, Metry.</b>

03:04.260 --> 03:06.600
<b>How can you be so careless?</b>

03:07.100 --> 03:08.480
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

03:09.600 --> 03:10.640
<b>There.</b>

03:10.730 --> 03:12.980
<b>Now you won't be swallowed up.</b>

03:14.900 --> 03:17.780
<b>Please tie your hair like this
when you are at work.</b>

03:21.110 --> 03:22.570
<b>The Madam is...</b>

03:22.660 --> 03:24.200
<b>like an older sister.</b>

03:24.950 --> 03:28.790
<b>I mean, it would be great to
have you as an older sister.</b>

03:30.540 --> 03:33.000
<b>No, that's not what I mean either.</b>

03:33.080 --> 03:34.380
<b>I mean...</b>

03:34.460 --> 03:35.880
<b>I...</b>

03:35.960 --> 03:37.590
<b>Look up to the Madam.</b>

03:38.380 --> 03:40.340
<b>I want to be a woman who is</b>

03:40.420 --> 03:43.430
<b>as perfect at everything as you are.</b>

03:46.350 --> 03:48.680
<b>That probably will never ever come true.</b>

03:49.600 --> 03:50.730
<b>Never ever?</b>

03:53.020 --> 03:54.440
<b>Be diligent.</b>

03:57.480 --> 03:58.570
<b>Yes, Madam.</b>

04:03.910 --> 04:06.780
<b>Metry, dust off from the top down.</b>

04:06.870 --> 04:08.790
<b>Ah, yes, Madam!</b>

04:15.170 --> 04:18.340
<b>Metry, this is the baking soda.</b>

04:19.300 --> 04:22.090
<b>You thought potato starch
would work for silverware?</b>

04:23.180 --> 04:24.890
<b>Yes, Madam.</b>

04:26.350 --> 04:29.850
<b><i>Pull the seam</i>
<i>and move it in one direction.</i></b>

04:29.930 --> 04:31.560
<b><i>Yes, Madam!</i></b>

04:31.640 --> 04:34.520
<b><i>Stitch the thread</i>
<i>without leaving any gaps.</i></b>

04:34.600 --> 04:36.150
<b><i>Yes, Madam!</i></b>

04:38.980 --> 04:41.740
<b>It suits you well, Metry.</b>

04:41.820 --> 04:44.400
<b>Thank you, sister.</b>

04:44.490 --> 04:47.370
<b>Ah, I'm sorry, I...</b>

04:48.330 --> 04:49.580
<b>Metry.</b>

04:52.700 --> 04:55.420
<b>EXAMINING ROOM</b>

04:55.500 --> 04:57.290
<b>Unfortunately</b>

04:57.380 --> 05:01.090
<b>it might be challenging
for you to conceive naturally.</b>

05:04.220 --> 05:05.430
<b>Mrs. Ichijo?</b>

05:06.510 --> 05:07.720
<b>Mrs. Ichijo?</b>

05:08.260 --> 05:09.390
<b><i>Mrs. Ichijo.</i></b>

05:10.810 --> 05:12.310
<b>Mommy!</b>

05:13.930 --> 05:15.520
<b>Hurry up.</b>

05:15.600 --> 05:16.810
<b>Hey, wait for me.</b>

05:25.650 --> 05:26.530
<b><i>Madam.</i></b>

05:27.490 --> 05:29.490
<b>After all, I...</b>

05:33.290 --> 05:35.250
<b>It's okay, Metry.</b>

05:35.330 --> 05:39.170
<b>The two of us are built
as similar as sisters.</b>

05:39.750 --> 05:41.250
<b><i>It will be dark in there.</i></b>

05:41.340 --> 05:43.840
<b><i>He won't know if you just stay quiet.</i></b>

05:44.670 --> 05:45.670
<b><i>But...</i></b>

05:46.880 --> 05:49.140
<b>Please, Metry.</b>

05:50.480 --> 05:52.760
<b>If you give birth to my child</b>

05:52.850 --> 05:56.060
<b>the happy Ichijo family will be complete.</b>

05:56.980 --> 05:57.980
<b>Metry.</b>

06:20.580 --> 06:21.840
<b>Madam?</b>

06:22.960 --> 06:24.920
<b>There's nothing.</b>

06:25.010 --> 06:26.300
<b>Madam.</b>

06:27.590 --> 06:30.550
<b>This isn't right. It really isn't.</b>

06:31.350 --> 06:33.510
<b>There's nothing wrong with this.</b>

06:33.600 --> 06:37.520
<b>Increasing your family is a blessing.</b>

06:38.850 --> 06:40.020
<b><i>Metry.</i></b>

06:42.730 --> 06:43.980
<b><i>Metry.</i></b>

06:47.070 --> 06:49.450
<b><i>You are a part of me.</i></b>

07:06.880 --> 07:07.880
<b>Metry!</b>

07:07.970 --> 07:09.420
<b>Sir!</b>

07:09.510 --> 07:12.180
<b>-Please let go.
-Metry, listen to me.</b>

07:13.180 --> 07:15.760
<b>It really was you.</b>

07:15.850 --> 07:19.560
<b>No. What are you talking about?</b>

07:19.640 --> 07:22.270
<b>-I'm going back to work.
-Wait.</b>

07:22.350 --> 07:23.730
<b>Please let me go.</b>

07:23.810 --> 07:27.530
<b>You have a perfect wife.</b>

07:27.610 --> 07:28.280
<b>No.</b>

07:29.400 --> 07:31.610
<b>I don't want perfection, I want you.</b>

07:35.950 --> 07:38.120
<b>You really are perfect, Reiko.</b>

07:38.870 --> 07:41.080
<b>You are a perfect woman.</b>

07:41.790 --> 07:43.880
<b>I want to be a woman who is</b>

07:43.960 --> 07:46.550
<b>as perfect at everything as you are.</b>

08:12.910 --> 08:14.530
<b>Looking back...</b>

08:14.620 --> 08:17.080
<b>Things started
going wrong after I met her.</b>

08:17.990 --> 08:19.830
<b>I did think it was strange.</b>

08:19.910 --> 08:23.040
<b>Nothing in my life had
ever been messed up until then.</b>

08:23.830 --> 08:26.710
<b>As expected,
after Metry was confined to her room,</b>

08:26.790 --> 08:30.010
<b>Reiko soon became pregnant.</b>

08:30.500 --> 08:33.970
<b>The devil gave birth to
two golden-haired male offspring,</b>

08:34.050 --> 08:38.430
<b>and Reiko carried
her husband's child, Eiji.</b>

08:38.820 --> 08:42.520
<b>Eventually, Metry
and the two offspring escaped the room.</b>

08:43.020 --> 08:45.150
<b>You know the rest.</b>

08:47.150 --> 08:50.940
<b>I was released from
the curse of imperfection</b>

08:51.030 --> 08:54.570
<b>that that devil Metry cast upon me.</b>

08:54.660 --> 08:56.110
<b>Nonsense!</b>

08:56.200 --> 08:57.490
<b>There's no curse!</b>

08:57.570 --> 09:00.790
<b>The doctor told you
you can't have kids, didn't he?</b>

09:02.080 --> 09:05.500
<b>Yes, because Metry cursed me.</b>

09:06.540 --> 09:08.500
<b>That is the end of our chat.</b>

09:17.260 --> 09:18.800
<b>Wait. Hey!</b>

09:21.140 --> 09:22.470
<b>I didn't sign up for this.</b>

09:38.870 --> 09:40.490
<b>Are you planning to kill us?</b>

09:40.580 --> 09:41.790
<b>Like you killed Mitchan.</b>

09:43.000 --> 09:45.790
<b>That maid knew too much.</b>

09:50.920 --> 09:53.460
<b>Don't come here. Go away!</b>

10:06.100 --> 10:06.770
<b>Okay now.</b>

10:07.900 --> 10:09.190
<b>Eiji...</b>

10:14.480 --> 10:16.150
<b>Let's go home.</b>

10:40.970 --> 10:42.050
<b>Eiji...</b>

10:43.760 --> 10:45.720
<b>I... understand now.</b>

10:49.900 --> 10:52.980
<b>Let's go home to your brothers.</b>

10:59.200 --> 11:01.870
<b>We are brothers.</b>

11:15.590 --> 11:17.970
<b>You did well, Metry.</b>

11:18.050 --> 11:20.260
<b>You gave birth to this many at once.</b>

11:32.690 --> 11:33.770
<b>Madam...</b>

11:42.820 --> 11:44.120
<b>He has been born.</b>

11:45.280 --> 11:47.660
<b>My baby.</b>

11:49.330 --> 11:50.500
<b>Madam!</b>

11:53.670 --> 11:55.750
<b>Do not worry.</b>

11:55.840 --> 11:58.340
<b>I will give this room to you.</b>

11:58.420 --> 12:03.800
<b>I can't just let you out on the streets
with two young children to care for.</b>

12:04.390 --> 12:06.510
<b>Make yourself comfortable.</b>

12:06.600 --> 12:07.720
<b>Madam!</b>

12:09.350 --> 12:12.140
<b><i>Madam! Wait!</i></b>

12:12.230 --> 12:15.270
<b><i>Madam! Madam!</i></b>

12:21.030 --> 12:23.570
<b>So adorable.</b>

12:24.280 --> 12:26.410
<b>My little baby...</b>

12:37.920 --> 12:39.300
<b>Madam...</b>

12:40.380 --> 12:42.420
<b>How is he doing?</b>

12:43.590 --> 12:45.760
<b>Please let me see him.</b>

12:46.680 --> 12:48.220
<b>Just for a second.</b>

12:58.230 --> 12:59.780
<b>Fish.</b>

12:59.860 --> 13:01.110
<b>Pish!</b>

13:01.190 --> 13:02.400
<b>Pith!</b>

13:05.320 --> 13:07.200
<b>It hit the prickles!</b>

13:07.280 --> 13:08.950
<b>Did not!</b>

13:11.450 --> 13:13.000
<b>Dali, are you done yet?</b>

13:13.080 --> 13:14.330
<b>Wait, Migi.</b>

13:15.370 --> 13:16.250
<b>It opened!</b>

13:28.680 --> 13:30.010
<b>There she is!</b>

13:30.100 --> 13:31.930
<b>She's here again.</b>

13:32.690 --> 13:34.940
<b>-Hey.
-Mom.</b>

13:36.440 --> 13:38.020
<b>What are you looking at?</b>

13:42.320 --> 13:43.820
<b>Mom?</b>

13:55.040 --> 13:57.460
<b>We're brothers?</b>

13:58.130 --> 14:01.210
<b>You're telling us... We're triplets?</b>

14:01.750 --> 14:02.420
<b>That's crazy.</b>

14:02.500 --> 14:05.670
<b>Our hair colors are completely different!</b>

14:05.760 --> 14:07.760
<b>No way we are siblings.</b>

14:08.680 --> 14:11.850
<b>The blonde woman told me...</b>

14:12.970 --> 14:15.730
<b>"Let's go home to your brothers."</b>

14:17.790 --> 14:20.610
<b>I suppose, on that Christmas night...</b>

14:20.690 --> 14:23.070
<b>She came to take me back.</b>

14:23.940 --> 14:26.030
<b>But I didn't know, so I...</b>

14:27.450 --> 14:30.780
<b>Where is our mother now? How is she?</b>

14:31.700 --> 14:32.530
<b>She's dead.</b>

14:34.620 --> 14:38.040
<b>She was killed by you, a stranger.</b>

14:39.500 --> 14:40.750
<b>I...</b>

14:41.750 --> 14:42.750
<b>killed her?</b>

14:44.300 --> 14:45.710
<b>How about</b>

14:46.340 --> 14:49.680
<b>you worry about your own mom instead?</b>

14:50.390 --> 14:51.090
<b>Huh?</b>

14:51.640 --> 14:52.600
<b>Right.</b>

15:05.150 --> 15:06.280
<b>Where did I...</b>

15:06.780 --> 15:08.360
<b>come from....</b>

15:08.450 --> 15:10.820
<b>and where do I go?</b>

15:18.580 --> 15:21.500
<b>Karen, where does it hurt now?</b>

15:21.580 --> 15:23.250
<b>My... spleen.</b>

15:23.340 --> 15:24.460
<b>Your spleen?</b>

15:26.000 --> 15:28.720
<b>Huh? Did you hear that voice from outside?</b>

15:31.760 --> 15:34.180
<b>Now it's my kneecaps!</b>

15:34.260 --> 15:35.180
<b>Your kneecaps?</b>

15:35.810 --> 15:38.850
<b><i>Finish this while
I can still keep that fool here,</i></b>

15:38.930 --> 15:41.400
<b><i>please, Beavers!</i></b>

15:43.310 --> 15:44.270
<b>Hey...</b>

15:44.770 --> 15:47.730
<b>Are you sure you're not going after them?</b>

15:48.320 --> 15:49.610
<b>Why would we?</b>

15:50.700 --> 15:53.070
<b>Why would you?</b>

15:53.160 --> 15:55.870
<b>Well, he's your brother, right?</b>

15:55.950 --> 15:57.200
<b>No!</b>

15:57.290 --> 15:58.660
<b>He isn't!</b>

16:02.290 --> 16:03.130
<b>Mom.</b>

16:03.920 --> 16:05.000
<b>Mom.</b>

16:07.520 --> 16:08.960
<b>I...</b>

16:09.050 --> 16:12.090
<b>How could I
fall asleep here of all places?</b>

16:12.180 --> 16:13.890
<b>Let's take care of your wound.</b>

16:13.970 --> 16:15.800
<b>Oh, Eiji...</b>

16:17.350 --> 16:20.560
<b>When did you learn how to walk?</b>

16:20.640 --> 16:22.020
<b>Can you walk?</b>

16:22.520 --> 16:24.400
<b>And you can talk, too.</b>

16:25.110 --> 16:27.020
<b>You're a smart boy.</b>

16:27.570 --> 16:29.230
<b>We have to finish this...</b>

16:29.320 --> 16:31.950
<b>Right... Finish this...</b>

16:32.030 --> 16:34.490
<b>Let's do it over again.</b>

16:35.530 --> 16:36.830
<b>But Dali...</b>

16:36.910 --> 16:39.790
<b>Our mom told him... to come home.</b>

16:41.370 --> 16:42.920
<b>Migi.</b>

16:43.000 --> 16:44.790
<b>Do you really believe him?</b>

16:45.190 --> 16:48.090
<b>Did you feel anything when he called you his brother?</b>

16:49.000 --> 16:50.460
<b>That's not...</b>

16:53.090 --> 16:54.760
<b>Huh? You two...</b>

16:54.840 --> 16:58.310
<b>My intestines! My! Intestines...</b>

16:58.390 --> 16:59.770
<b>Karen!</b>

17:01.640 --> 17:03.520
<b>You're the Sonoyama's...</b>

17:04.020 --> 17:06.060
<b>You're twins?</b>

17:06.690 --> 17:09.320
<b>And you're breaking in in the middle of the night.</b>

17:09.400 --> 17:10.860
<b>I cannot ignore that.</b>

17:10.940 --> 17:13.030
<b>I will call the Sonoyamas.</b>

17:13.110 --> 17:14.530
<b>Wait, please.</b>

17:14.610 --> 17:18.030
<b>There is a reason for this,
and it's sturdier than a dam.</b>

17:18.120 --> 17:19.240
<b>Father-in-law.</b>

17:20.380 --> 17:22.700
<b>Karen, who is he?</b>

17:22.790 --> 17:24.160
<b>Excuse my manners.</b>

17:24.250 --> 17:26.960
<b>I am Karen's official boyfriend.</b>

17:27.040 --> 17:28.920
<b>My name is Maruta Tsutsumi.</b>

17:29.000 --> 17:30.670
<b>I did not know of this, Karen.</b>

17:30.750 --> 17:32.420
<b>You know now, don't you?</b>

17:36.680 --> 17:38.010
<b>Reiko!</b>

17:48.440 --> 17:50.440
<b>Reiko...</b>

17:53.150 --> 17:54.360
<b>Reiko...</b>

17:54.440 --> 17:55.360
<b>Reiko...</b>

17:55.900 --> 17:57.410
<b>This can't be...</b>

17:58.490 --> 17:59.620
<b>It's Eiji.</b>

17:59.960 --> 18:02.210
<b>Eiji killed her.</b>

18:11.340 --> 18:12.380
<b>Wait.</b>

18:16.720 --> 18:18.680
<b>I need to make certain of something.</b>

18:19.380 --> 18:22.060
<b>Karen, step back.</b>

18:22.140 --> 18:23.060
<b>Move.</b>

18:44.080 --> 18:45.200
<b>Reiko!</b>

18:47.920 --> 18:49.100
<b>You're alive--</b>

18:50.820 --> 18:52.090
<b><i>I have</i></b>

18:52.170 --> 18:55.260
<b><i>decided to live for Eiji's sake.</i></b>

18:56.050 --> 18:57.930
<b>What are you saying?</b>

18:58.010 --> 19:01.140
<b><i>I talked to him, you see.</i></b>

19:01.220 --> 19:03.350
<b><i>About what will happen now.</i></b>

19:03.430 --> 19:06.270
<b><i>He said he wants to redo everything too.</i></b>

19:06.350 --> 19:10.020
<b><i>So the two of us will go</i>
<i>somewhere where no one knows us</i></b>

19:10.100 --> 19:12.980
<b><i>and start over from zero.</i></b>

19:13.070 --> 19:16.360
<b><i>This time we will have</i>
<i>a much more perfect life.</i></b>

19:16.620 --> 19:18.650
<b>What... What are you saying?</b>

19:21.510 --> 19:24.870
<b><i>You were an ideal husband. </i></b>

19:24.950 --> 19:25.870
<b>It's just</b>

19:25.950 --> 19:30.000
<b><i>sometimes the smell of pomade</i>
<i>ripped my nostrils.</i></b>

19:30.080 --> 19:31.330
<b><i>Karen.</i></b>

19:31.420 --> 19:34.960
<b><i>You ended up not</i>
<i>looking like me or your father.</i></b>

19:35.590 --> 19:38.300
<b><i>Hitori, do not worry.</i></b>

19:38.380 --> 19:40.470
<b><i>I am sure the Sonoyamas</i></b>

19:40.550 --> 19:44.600
<b><i>are already</i>
<i>preparing to adopt a new child.</i></b>

19:47.930 --> 19:49.560
<b><i>And lastly...</i></b>

19:52.810 --> 19:54.980
<b><i>Everyone, be well.</i></b>

19:55.070 --> 19:57.570
<b>Hey! Open the door!</b>

19:57.650 --> 19:58.740
<b>Let us out!</b>

19:59.140 --> 20:02.780
<b><i>Mommy!</i></b>

21:53.230 --> 21:55.640
<b>Eiji my dear, are you ready to go?</b>

21:56.270 --> 21:58.110
<b>Almost.</b>

21:58.190 --> 22:02.030
<b>He really inherited my meticulousness.</b>

22:02.110 --> 22:04.360
<b>Eiji, where do you want to go?</b>

22:05.110 --> 22:06.820
<b>Somewhere desolate.</b>

22:06.910 --> 22:08.410
<b>That's nice.</b>

22:08.490 --> 22:11.490
<b>How about Moravian Tuscany?</b>

22:12.330 --> 22:15.210
<b>It's like we're going on a picnic,
I'm getting all giddy.</b>

22:18.670 --> 22:19.750
<b>Oh, Eiji.</b>

22:20.460 --> 22:22.170
<b>Is that all you're bringing?</b>

22:23.020 --> 22:25.670
<b>Guess that's fine. Let us go.</b>

22:27.380 --> 22:30.220
<b>No, please go ahead.</b>

22:30.610 --> 22:31.780
<b>Huh?</b>

22:37.900 --> 22:40.020
<b>I will follow right behind you.</b>

22:50.240 --> 22:52.370
<b>Ei...ji...</b>

22:57.370 --> 22:59.580
<b>This family is messed up...</b>

23:32.200 --> 23:33.660
<b>It has to go.</b>
